Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们记得上大学时 罗斯爱上卡萝…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross? Remember when he fell in love with Carol...{\r}
