Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样就可以收回你说的话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That'll turn back time.{\r}
