Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我到纽约的第一个晚上 他说过要约我出去…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My first night in the city, he mentioned asking me out...{\r}
