Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes!{\r}
