Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不好意思，先生、先生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me! Sir! Excuse me! Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 有人请我传话给你 - 是什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- I have a message for you. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋说她很喜欢你送的礼物 她会等你回来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's from Rachel. She loved the present. She'll see you when you get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}托碧 我不知道她在说什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Toby, I don't know what she's talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有瑞秋这个女人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There's no Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要跟我冷战{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Don't give me that deep freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢，乔伊、乔伊、乔伊！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Joey, Joey, Joey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想我刚失去了知觉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I think I blacked out there for a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这不算什么啦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在换你享受罗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, now we gotta find something fun for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ahh, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别管我了 你再来一次吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Forget about me. Let's, uh... Let's give you another turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我再一次{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Me, again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有何不可{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sure. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇，有人明天 会拿到一个超大的水果篮！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Boy! Somebody's gonna get a big fruit basket tomorrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得说，乔伊 你跟我想像中的完全不一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I gotta tell you, you are nothing like I thought you would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我以为你是 凡事只想到自己的男人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just had you pegged as one of those guys who are always, "Me, me, me!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 哈哈 - 可是你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Ha, ha. - But you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}竟然这么替别人着想{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...you're a giver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是我碰过最大方体贴的男人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're, like, the most generous man I ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你根本就是个女人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, you're practically a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋 你要把包装纸留起来吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, uh, Rach, do you want to save this wrapping paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只有点破{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's only a little torn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你想跟罗斯在一起吗 还是我该把这东西给丢了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are you gonna go for it with Ross, or should I throw it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道、我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我去的时候一直在想…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thought about it all of the way there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}回来的时候也一直想…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I thought about it all the way back and, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}竟然是罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, it's Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们知道我的意思吗 我跟罗斯耶{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know what I mean? It's Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 是啊！ - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Sure! - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道 我的直觉告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. This is just my initial gut feeling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but I'm thinking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这样应该会很棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...it'd be really great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，我也这样觉得耶！ 我们会变成朋友兼亲家！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God, me too! Oh, we'd be like friends-in-law!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}最棒的是 你对他已经很了解{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The best part is you already know everything about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}感觉就像第十五次约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's like starting on the 15th date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对啊，一开始就像 已经约会十五次了一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But it would be like starting on the 15th date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}说的好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Another good point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的意思是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}通常约会到第十五次 双方就应该已经在交往{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}At the 15th date, you're already in a "relationship-y" place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}确定要在一起了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}呵{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果事情不成怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What happens if it doesn't work out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 为什么会不成？ - 不知道，有时候就是会这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Why isn't it working out? - I don't know, sometimes it doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他不够帅吗？ 还是赚的钱不够多？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is he not cute enough for you? Does he not make enough money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 不是啦，我只是… - 也许她有别的对象{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- No, I'm just... - Maybe there's someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是吗？你还有别的对象吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is there? Is there someone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 没有啊，没有别人 - 那你干嘛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- No, there is no one else. - Then why the hell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}甩掉我哥？  - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...are you dumping my brother?  - Wha...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿，大… - 嘘！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey, big... - Shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}慈善家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Spender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她还在睡觉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's still asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 结果怎样？ - 太神奇了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- So how'd it go? - It was amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道那种自认很行的感觉吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know how you think you're great in bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你会问我那种问题 就代表你根本不了解我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The fact you'd even ask shows how little you know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}昨晚我没办法表现{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, it's like, last night I couldn't do the thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拿手的技巧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...that usually makes me great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以我只好想别的办法{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I had to do all this other stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}结果我得到的回应超赞的！ 老兄，不是我想自夸！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And the response I got! Man, oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好像去参加碎纸花游行一样开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was like a ticker-tape parade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道，我房间 离游行路线非常非常近{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes I know. As it happens, my room is very close to the parade route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那种感觉真的很棒，不只是她 我也觉得超赞的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It was amazing, and not just for her. Uh-uh. For me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那种感觉就像是 我突然间看不见了…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's like, all of a sudden, I'm blind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可是其他的感官却都变敏锐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but all my other senses are heightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我好像可以体会到…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know? It's like, I was able to appreciate it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}另一种层次的喜悦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...on another level.{\r}
