Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}做不到是吧？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Can't do it, can you?{\r}
