Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 罗斯，这对我来说太难了 - 不…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs11\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Ross, it's too hard. - No, no.{\r}
